      "review_summary": "The PR changes ClickClack websocket message handling to reject non-Error async handler failures as an Error with a ClickClack-specific message and cause while preserving existing Error instances.\n\nPR surface: Source +4. Total +4 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source: current main and v2026.6.11 pass websocket handler failures to `reject` raw, and the PR changes that rejection shape. The downstream regression is also source-reproducible because `server-channels.ts` formats the wrapped Error through `formatErrorMessage`, which does not serialize object/number causes.",
